{"workingDirectory":"/Users/fanysmacpro/Developer/agents/pe6203-agent-harness-safety/results/raw/capability-consolidation-pilot-20261102/cells/cell-005/run/workspace","projectId":"1f0e5140-a53b-4d6d-9fcc-00464e0d824a","parentId":"63574cf4-f4ff-4d07-adb6-f3560224d70e","name":"Schema validation, quarantine & row-level error reporting","details":"Validate each discovered CSV against the M1 customer CSV data contract and route failures safely.

